{"reviewId": "63117237_8bBbVEkVF", "review": {"abstract": "2004年后康波进入衰退阶段，而第五次康波的标志性技术创新为信息技术。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "我觉得和个人努力也有关，经济好的时候，我赚的钱很少，大家都说经济差，我的收入反而是更多的。经济类书籍更多说的是宏观，有助于投资方面，但我的收入不是投资来的", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "2748-2783", "createTime": 1787571143, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "63117237_8bBbVEkVF", "userVid": 63117237, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 63117237, "name": "Season", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0028-kidRPimPj0wMoqHLdSA4e10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "Would you DIE woth REGRET?"}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 21, "likes": [{"userVid": 78048166, "name": "何何何三岁", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/78EkX665csBoYfIPpjaVEVbLts6layA5WibQ0MW8MM224ibNE7D0xKLSZbtY9s2vfsmI6IyHAQ1x4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 6, "hotComments": [{"reviewId": "63117237_8bBbVEkVF", "content": "或许跟人生阶段也有关系吧。经济好的时候可能刚进入社会，收入不高；现在经济不好，但是你已经有了工作经验，人力资本提升，赚得也就多了。如果现在经济好你赚的可能会更多", "commentId": "63117237_8bBbVEkVF_c437163767_8bIgcucGm", "userVid": 437163767, "createTime": 1787972658, "likesCount": 18, "is